+## Request 14: Customer statements
+**Status**: ✅ Completed and tested
+
+### What was done
+- Created `src/statements.js` with `statement(customerId, invoices, asOf)`
+- Generates customer statement showing outstanding invoices
+- Filters for customer's invoices with status 'issued' or 'partially_paid'
+- Includes only invoices with issueDate on or before asOf
+- Returns: { customerId, invoices: [...], totalDue }
+- Each invoice includes: { number, issueDate, dueDate, total, due }
